// **Play as one ant: the queen's start** -- the play-as-an-ant game's first
// playable box (`Reports/play-as-ant-slice1-2026-10-11.md`). Open it with
// `cargo run --release --bin lab -- scenario=queen_start`; the lab goes into
// queen mode (`lab::queen`) and WASD plus E Q F G B L T drive her.
//
// - **One queen, a colony of one**, at column 256, steered by the keys at
//   4x and below. She starts with 900 J granted on top of the ant's 200 J:
//   slice 0's scripted player reached twenty workers on 10 of 12 seeds at
//   900 J against 8 of 12 at none (median 11,400 frames).
// - **A food spot 60 columns east that tops itself up** (`Larder`): 20 cells
//   of provisions every 1,000 frames while fewer than 60 lie within 12
//   columns of it. Slice 0's steady-income heap (40 cells every 1,000 frames
//   with no cap) buried a lone queen on 6 of 24 runs; a capped spot cannot.
// - **The planted box**: two herbs clear of the nest, the mister at its
//   shipped default (the planted-balance lane found a rain-off herb bed
//   empties).
// - **No beetles** (owner's card, 2026-10-11): four beetles killed a lone
//   queen on 12 of 12 seeds within 800 frames.
(
    name: "queen_start",
    title: "PLAY AS THE QUEEN",
    question: "You are one founding queen with a food spot to the east: can you raise twenty workers?",
    bed: (
        width: 512,
        height: 320,
        soil_depth: 80,
        ground_y: 160,
        compartments: 1,
        founders: 0,
        species: "herb",
        colonies: 0,
        colony_ants: 1,
        colony_species: "ant",
        predators: 0,
        lamp_spacing: 33,
        seed: 1,
        extra_walls: [],
    ),
    settings: [],
    placements: [
        Plant(species: "herb", x: 128),
        Plant(species: "herb", x: 384),
        Queen(species: "ant", x: 256, reserve: 900),
        Larder(material: "provisions", x: 316, cells: 20, cap: 60),
    ],
    timeline: [
        (at: 1000, every: 1000, until: 0, what: Larder(material: "provisions", x: 316, cells: 20, cap: 60)),
    ],
    horizon: 432000,
)
